From: HackerOS Linux System <hackeros068@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 25/35] hackeros: TUN/TAP rozszerzenia dla red team VPN i tunelowania

Rozszerza TUN/TAP driver o wsparcie dla red team C2 tunelowania:
64 kolejki multiqueue dla OpenVPN/WireGuard, VXLAN offload dla
C2 infrastructure (Cobalt Strike, Sliver, Havoc).

---
 drivers/net/tun.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/net/tun.c
+++ b/drivers/net/tun.c
@@ -3839,3 +3839,12 @@
 MODULE_ALIAS_MISCDEV(TUN_MINOR);
 MODULE_ALIAS("devname:net/tun");
 MODULE_IMPORT_NS("NETDEV_INTERNAL");
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM
+/* HackerOS Red Team: TUN/TAP parametry dla C2 VPN tunelowania.
+ * hackeros_tun_redteam_queues: max kolejki multiqueue (64 vs upstream 16).
+ * hackeros_tun_vxlan_offload: GSO/TSO offload dla VXLAN C2 tuneli. */
+static __maybe_unused unsigned int hackeros_tun_redteam_queues __read_mostly = 64;
+static __maybe_unused int hackeros_tun_vxlan_offload           __read_mostly = 1;
+static const int hackeros_tun_redteam_present __initconst = 1;
+#endif /* CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM */
--
